<title>USA: Industrie Natuzzi sets 2-for-1 stock split.</title>
<headline>Industrie Natuzzi sets 2-for-1 stock split.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Industrie Natuzzi SpA said Tuesday that its board of directors approved at two-for-one split of the company's ordinary shares.</p>
<p>The company said that the split was subject to shareholder approval.</p>
</text>
